{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00695","headline":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 亚献终献 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 亚献终献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟清惟肃，靡闻靡见。\n举备九成，俛终三献。\n庆彰曼寿，胙彻嘉荐。\n瘗玉埋牲，礼神斯徧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}